  first\-run  IN PERSON, at the server: create the master key and show the 24 words ONCE on this screen (never written to a file or log), ask three of them back, then register the first admin app key (owner) so the app can sign from day one
\&
Options:
      \-\-data\-dir <DATA_DIR>  Data dir override (beats ITCMDR_DATA_DIR and server.json)
      \-\-json                 Print JSON instead of text
      \-\-plain\-http           v1.1.0: talk to the local server over plain HTTP instead of HTTPS (not encrypted; explicit opt\-in)
  \-h, \-\-help                 Print help
.fi
