.SH COMMAND: itcmdr\-cli restore\-stage
.nf
Restore through the running server (the app's StageRestore path): the server verifies the archive, then itcmdr\-restore stops the service, restores, restarts and health\-checks, and rolls back on failure. Words on stdin. Signed with this server's root key (owner)
\&
Usage: itcmdr\-cli restore\-stage [OPTIONS] \-\-backup <BACKUP>
\&
Options:
      \-\-backup <BACKUP>      Archive name from `backup list`
      \-\-data\-dir <DATA_DIR>  Data dir override (beats ITCMDR_DATA_DIR and server.json)
      \-\-json                 Print JSON instead of text
      \-\-wait                 Wait until the restore finished and print each step
      \-\-plain\-http           v1.1.0: talk to the local server over plain HTTP instead of HTTPS (not encrypted; explicit opt\-in)
  \-h, \-\-help                 Print help
.fi
